Z||000000||jlruiz67||06-19-2001||07:03 PM||||Hello all<P>    Can anyone post my pics on this post?<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/003704.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum4/HTML/003704.html</A> <P>Need to sell my 87 GT Automatic after the 15 of July but before the 25th, I'm moving, here are the details:<BR>-1987 GT <BR>-Automatic<BR>-210,000 miles<BR>-Med. Metallic Red (Mostly good shape except the wing and faded spots on the deck lid.)<BR>-Non-working cruise control (I don't know what’s wrong)<BR>-A/C has a broken hose.<BR>-If I drive mostly freeway at normal speeds I get about 20 miles per gallon, city I get 18. <BR>-Just replaced the exhaust manifold closest to the firewall.<BR>-It has Flowmaster muffler on (has developed a little rattle)<BR>-New O2 sensor<BR>-K&N Air Filter<BR>-Great sound with a new AM/FM CD Player, Sony 50X4 with 2 pre amp outputs.<BR>-Speakers are not stock, I think there are all Kenwood.<BR>-Great interior, usual small tear on the driver's seat. <BR>-Regular tune-ups and oil changed every 3,000 miles<BR>-Never in accident<BR>-Sunroof<BR>-Very clean car<BR>-I have brand new KYB struts in box never used, front KYB installed<BR>-Rear sway bar<BR>-Fairly new front tires and brand new rears, BFGoodrich 225/50R15 Euro T/A's on all 4’s<BR>-The car runs very strong<BR>-I'm the second owner<BR>-Also replaced radiator on 98<BR>-replaced water pump on 99 or 2000 I still have receipt somewhere.<P><BR>Please if you could use more information please ask. Please make an offer I'm looking for $1,500. The car is in Dana Point, California<P>Let me know if you can and I'll email you the pictures to upload, for some strange reason I'm getting errors or password request when I try to upload the pictures.<P><BR>Thank you much<P><p>[This message has been edited by jlruiz67 (edited 06-19-2001).]||||reg||4
